  Description: The potency of Spellmasters past flows through you. When you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Identify
    Magic], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Recall Knowledge], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Trick
    Magic Item], you can spend a Mythic Point to make the check at mythic proficiency.
    The first time each day that you critically succeed on a check with a skill corresponding
    to any magical traditions you possess while Identifying Magic, Recalling Knowledge,
    or Tricking a Magic Item, you regain a Mythic Point.
